        "explanationEn": "This divine teaching is expressed in Shloka 24: «नैवाऽपि तत्त्वतो भक्तिः परमानन्दप्रापणम्। नाऽपि त्रिविधतापानां नाशो ब्रह्मगुरुं विना॥»\nMeaning: Without the Brahmaswarup guru, perfect devotion also cannot be offered, ultimate bliss cannot be attained and the three types of misery also cannot be eradicated. (24)",
