        "questionEn": "Which Sanskrit verse conveys this divine teaching?\n«Satsangis should daily read this ‘Satsang Diksha’ shastra with concentration. Those who are unable to read should lovingly listen to it. Moreover, all should faithfully endeavor to practice it. (293–294)»",
